        took the log of the raw score instead of the E-value), while the default merge path keyed
        spectra on a scan number parsed only from "scan="/"index=" native IDs and silently collapsed
        every PSM into one spectrum for the widespread "spectrum=" (MS:1000777), Sciex "sample=" and
        "file=" formats. Combine results from several search engines with ConsensusID instead.
        The correspondingly unused PercolatorFeatureSetHelper methods concatMULTISEPeptideIds,
        mergeMULTISEPeptideIds, addMULTISEFeatures and addCONCATSEFeatures were removed from the
