    - OpenSwathWorkflowScheduler: SWATH wave scheduling extracted from OpenSwathWorkflow; manages compound
      batches, per-SWATH scoring job queues and deferred OSW output with memory-based flushing (#9190)
    - CalibrationWorkflow: OpenSwathWorkflowCalibration logic extracted into a reusable class (#8743). RT
      extraction windows estimated by it are now clamped between the configurable
      Calibration:windows:min_rt_window (default 60 s) and max_rt_window (default 600 s), either of which
